{"answer": 5, "html": "\n  <div class=\"sol-box\">다항함수를 미분한 뒤 \\(x=1\\)을 대입한다.</div>\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <p><span class=\"sol-num\">1</span></p>\n    $$\n   f'(x)=6x^2+4.\n   $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">2</span> 따라서</div>\n    $$\n   f'(1)=6+4=10.\n   $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-final\">답 &nbsp;⑤</div>\n"}